00:00:02.744 --> 00:00:03.757
- It's so lovely to meet you.

00:00:03.757 --> 00:00:04.771
- You're so talented.

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:06.029
Not just an actor, a singer,

00:00:06.029 --> 00:00:07.469
like every, you're so gifted.

00:00:07.469 --> 00:00:09.016
So I thank you for being on the show.

00:00:09.016 --> 00:00:10.711
- Thank you so much for
having me! What a treat.

00:00:10.711 --> 00:00:11.725
- I'm very, very excited.

00:00:11.725 --> 00:00:13.368
So wait, so what I said, the what?

00:00:13.368 --> 00:00:14.818
Those were your actual performance?

00:00:14.818 --> 00:00:15.811
That, that's actually what they said.

00:00:15.811 --> 00:00:16.644
Your reviews.

00:00:16.644 --> 00:00:17.477
- That's very kind.

00:00:17.477 --> 00:00:18.573
- That's the critics are loving you.

00:00:18.573 --> 00:00:20.259
Well, I'm scared of you.

00:00:20.259 --> 00:00:21.092
- Okay.

00:00:21.092 --> 00:00:22.744
- Because that film is,

00:00:22.744 --> 00:00:23.757
I watched it last night

00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:24.739
and then I went to bed

00:00:24.739 --> 00:00:27.041
and I was like, "Probably
shouldn't have done that."

00:00:27.041 --> 00:00:27.874
Yeah.

00:00:27.874 --> 00:00:31.149
Like, humans are capable
of just crazy things.

00:00:31.149 --> 00:00:31.982
- Absolutely.

00:00:31.982 --> 00:00:33.005
- And you're great in everything.

00:00:33.005 --> 00:00:33.947
I love you in everything.

00:00:33.947 --> 00:00:34.780
- [Eddie] Oh, thank you!

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:35.613
- And I can't wait to
talk about The Good Nurse.

00:00:35.613 --> 00:00:36.446
- But-

00:00:36.446 --> 00:00:37.279
- Yeah.

00:00:37.279 --> 00:00:38.112
- I have to ask because you have kids.

00:00:38.112 --> 00:00:38.945
