00:00:42.188 --> 00:00:43.063
You play a wizard.

00:00:43.063 --> 00:00:43.896
So...

00:00:43.896 --> 00:00:45.600
- You know, my kids are little.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.670
They came to the set of The Good Nurse.

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:48.503
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:48.503 --> 00:00:49.336
- And they knew

00:00:49.336 --> 00:00:51.435
